# Chicken Cacciatore

Based on [Essential Instant Pot:69](https://smile.amazon.com/Essential-Instant-Pot-Cookbook-Foolproof/dp/0399580883/ref=sr_1_1_sspa?ie=UTF8&qid=1516461807&sr=8-1-spons&keywords=essential+instant+pot&psc=1)

{ rating="5" image="chicken_cacciatore.jpg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 6 [Qt. Instant Pot]{ ing="qt-instant-pot" }
- [ ] 2-3 lbs of [boneless chicken]{ ing="boneless-chicken" }
- [ ] [salt & pepper]{ ing="salt-pepper" }
- [ ] 1 Tbsp [olive oil]{ ing="olive-oil" }
- [ ] 2 [bell peppers]{ ing="bell-peppers" }, sliced lengthwise into strips (red and yellow)
- [ ] 1 [yellow onion]{ ing="yellow-onion" }, rough chopped
- [ ] 3 cloves of [garlic]{ ing="garlic" }, chopped
- [ ] can [diced tomatoes + liquid]{ ing="diced-tomatoes-liquid" }
- [ ] 1/2 cup [red wine]{ ing="red-wine" }, like Cabernet Sauvignon
- [ ] 1/4 cup [water]{ ing="water" }
- [ ] 2 Tbsp [tomato paste]{ ing="tomato-paste" }
- [ ] 1.5 [DIY Tbsp Italian seasoning]{ ing="diy-tbsp-italian-seasoning" } ([source](https://www.themediterraneandish.com/italian-seasoning/#wprm-recipe-container-55714) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20251015141718/https://www.themediterraneandish.com/italian-seasoning/)))

      - [ ] 2 tsp [dried basil]{ ing="dried-basil" }
      - [ ] 2 tsp [dried thyme]{ ing="dried-thyme" }
      - [ ] 2 tsp [dried rosemary]{ ing="dried-rosemary" }
      - [ ] 2 tsp [dried marjoram]{ ing="dried-marjoram" }
      - [ ] 2 tsp [dried parsley]{ ing="dried-parsley" }
      - [ ] 4 tsp [dried oregano]{ ing="dried-oregano" }
- [ ] 1/4 tsp [red pepper flakes]{ ing="red-pepper-flakes" }
- [ ] 1 [bay leaf]{ ing="bay-leaf" }
- [ ] [great with egg noodles]{ ing="great-with-egg-noodles" } or a baguette

## Recipe

1. Season [chicken]{ ing="boneless-chicken" } with [salt & pepper]{ ing="salt-pepper" }. Place [olive oil]{ ing="olive-oil" } in [instant pot]{ ing="qt-instant-pot" } and put thighs skin-side down. Use _Sauté_ setting for 4 minutes.
1. Remove chicken and add [bell pepper]{ ing="bell-peppers" }, [onion]{ ing="yellow-onion" }, and [garlic]{ ing="garlic" }. _Sauté_ setting for 3 minutes.
1. Add tomatoes and [liquid]{ ing="diced-tomatoes-liquid" }, [wine]{ ing="red-wine" }, [water]{ ing="water" } (broth), [tomato paste]{ ing="tomato-paste" }, [Italian seasoning]{ ing="diy-tbsp-italian-seasoning" }, [red pepper flakes]{ ing="red-pepper-flakes" }, and [bay leaf]{ ing="bay-leaf" }, combine. Add the chicken back to pot and fully coat in liquid - make sure chicken sits in one layer.
1. In parallel, boil a pot of water and prepare the [egg noodles]{ ing="great-with-egg-noodles" } according to package directions
1. Seal and select _Meat_ to cook for 12 minutes at high pressure, then quick release steam
1. Remove the lid and choose saute for 15 minutes to reduce the sauce
